# REQUIRES: sps-scan-unary
# Fixture tier: PreflightV1; output is scanner-specific triage, not Section 10.
# Negative calibration for an always-reporting scanner. Zero findings here is
# scanner silence only; it is never ModelStatus: Proved.
# RUN: %sps-scan --refine-address %harness/mlir/alloca-size/public-control/alloca_size_public.control.mlir | %FileCheck %s
# CHECK-NOT: [secret-dependent-
# CHECK: findings: 0
